a) 3 International Training Programmes, namely, ‘Planning & Designing Aspects of Smart Cities’, ‘Formal Solutions of Informal Settlements’ and ‘Planning & Management of Sustainable Infrastructure’, of six weeks each fully sponsored by the Ministry of External Affairs, Government of India under its ITEC programme, covering a total of 80 officers/ professionals from 42 Countries;

b) 1 training programme namely ‘Good Governance’ sponsored by TCPO of 3 weeks for TCPO Socio-Economic Cadre Officers attended by 17 officials;

c) 11 In-house training programmes for HUDCO officials, in the discipline of Law, Finance, Projects, IT and others, on various topics like NCLT, Ind-AS, GST, Digital Payment, Succession Planning Policy, ISO., etc., participated by 381 officials imparting training of 596 man-days ; and

